{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">STORY:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player controls woman character in this third person low poly shooter. Player character is called Lara and She is only who can defeat zombie armies in place called Valkeala. Valkeala is separated 4 different small open world maps, which are full of different zombies. 4 different zombie types. Player Lara can use melee knife to beat zombies or then 2 different weapons: Pistol and Rifle. Player can also collect more ammos and pineapples to get more health</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">4 different locations</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different zombies:</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 -\u00a0<strong>Normal Zombie</strong> \u2013 just idle and walk slowly</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Pitchfork Zombie</strong> \u2013 More aggressive, equipped with a pitchfork.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\u00a0- Beehive Zombie</strong> \u2013 Leaves behind a lingering <strong>damage area</strong> even after death.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>- Axe Zombie</strong> \u2013 Moves faster, dealing higher damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2 different weapons: Pistol, Rifle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Melee knife attack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam achievements. Collect Steam achievements by playing enough long at different maps</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">CONTROLS:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Aim = Right mouse button</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump= Space bar</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interact with items = E</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip pistol = 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Equip rifle = 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unarmed = 3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reload = R</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Roll = Left ctrl</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Melee attack = V</p><p class=\"